---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/layout/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/layout/Footer.astro';
---
<Base title="matterunknown" description="Ryan Silver's site. Research on identity — especially the identity of AI agents — and smaller projects built in the open.">
<style>
  .lede { font-size: 1.08rem; }
  .lede p { color: var(--text); }
  .lede p + p { color: var(--text-2); }
</style>

<Nav variant="full" active="/" />

<main class="col">
  <div class="lede">
    <p>I'm Ryan Silver. I work on identity — how systems decide who you are, and lately, what identity means for AI agents acting on our behalf.</p>
    <p>This site is where I publish that research, and where I keep the smaller things I build because I want them to exist: a contacts app, a market scanner, card-pricing models, a Roblox farm made with my son. All of it runs in the open — the methods, the trades, and the mistakes are public.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>Writing</h2>
  <ul class="rows">
    <li><span class="d">Aug 2026</span><a class="t" href="/writing/retiring-vessel">Retiring Vessel</a></li>
    <li><span class="d">Jul 2026</span><a class="t" href="/writing/the-credential-remembers-who">The Credential Remembers Who. Nothing Remembers Why.</a></li>
    <li><span class="d">Jul 2026</span><a class="t" href="/writing/the-workload-is-the-reasoning-session">The Workload Is the Reasoning Session</a></li>
    <li><span class="d">Jun 2026</span><a class="t" href="/writing/pokemon-card-market">The Card Market Has a Data Problem</a></li>
    <li><span class="d">May 2026</span><a class="t" href="/writing/vibe-coding-roblox">Vibe Coding with My 10 Year Old</a></li>
  </ul>
  <p class="note" style="margin-top:.75rem"><a href="/writing">All writing</a> · start with <a href="/model">the identity framework</a></p>

  <h2>Projects</h2>
  <ul class="rows">
    <li><a class="t" href="https://commonlist.matterunknown.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Commonlist</a> — one clean address book across Google, Microsoft, Outlook, and iCloud</li>
    <li><a class="t" href="/projects/quant-trading">Quant scanner</a> — 100 symbols scanned nightly, every trade public</li>
    <li><a class="t" href="/projects/pokemon-model">Card models</a> — Pokémon, One Piece, and Garbage Pail Kids, scored daily</li>
    <li><a class="t" href="/projects/identity-map">Identity Surface Map</a> — how many versions of you exist across systems</li>
    <li><a class="t" href="/projects/password-graveyard">The Password Graveyard</a> — when your password died, and what killed it</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="note" style="margin-top:.75rem"><a href="/projects">All projects</a> · what's running right now is on <a href="/now">the now page</a></p>
</main>

<Footer />
</Base>
